# KIPPER: the sea's structure: 20 fuel tanks, 20 torpedo kits, 20 eggs and
# 10 pieces of equipment; every pick-up, Auntie Roe, both docks and the lair
# can be reached once every way is open; the layout and art are sound.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
expect nitems_0 == 20
expect nitems_1 == 20
expect nitems_2 == 20
expect nitems_3 == 10
expect nfoes == 85
expect nbrk == 52
expect reach == 0
expect layout == 0
expect art_bad == 0
